    <briefdescription>
<para>Configuration for a single quality gate. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Quality gates are pass/fail checks applied to extracted legal provisions. Each gate has a name, a numeric threshold (where applicable), and an action to take when the gate fails. </para>
